            <t:listBibl type="secondary">
               <t:bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/KRCWARVB"><seg type="encyclopediaArticle"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Lusini2005EAEDersanaRufael"/><title level="a">Dǝrsanä Rufaʾel</title><title type="short">EAe</title><title level="m">Encyclopaedia Aethiopica</title><author><forename>Gianfrancesco</forename><surname>Lusini</surname></author><editor><forename>Siegbert</forename><surname>Uhlig</surname></editor><pubPlace>Wiesbaden</pubPlace><publisher>Harrassowitz Verlag</publisher><date>2005</date><biblScope unit="volume">II</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">141a</biblScope><note type="tags"><note type="tag">bm:Lusini2005EAEDersanaRufael</note></note><note type="tag">bm:Lusini2005EAEDersanaRufael</note></t:bibl>
            </t:listBibl>
            
            <t:div type="edition">       
               <t:div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="LIT7214HomilyJCRuf">
                  <t:label>Homily by John Chrysostom on the archangel Raphael</t:label>
               </t:div>
               
               <t:div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="Miracles">
                  <t:label>First collection of miracles of the archangel Raphael</t:label>
                  <t:div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:id="MiracleImage">
                     <t:label>On creating a large image of Raphael</t:label>
                     <t:note>
                        The following incipit is taken from <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/BAVet130">Vatican City, Biblioteca Apostolica Vaticana, Aeth. 130</t:ref> according to <t:bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/QZH8VYBF"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices"/><title level="m">Bybliothecae apostolicae Vaticanae codices manu scripti recensiti iussu Pii XI Pontificis maximi. Codices Aethiopici Vaticani et Borgiani, Barberinianus orientalis 2, Rossianus 865&lt;hi rend="italics"&gt;, I:&lt;/hi&gt; Enarratio codicum</title><author><t:forename>Sylvain</t:forename><t:surname>Grébaut</t:surname></author><author><t:forename>Eugène</t:forename><t:surname>Tisserant</t:surname></author><pubPlace>Città del Vaticano</pubPlace><publisher>In Bybliotheca Vaticana</publisher><date>1935</date><t:citedRange unit="page">522</t:citedRange></t:bibl>.
                     </t:note>
                     <t:ab>
                        በእንተ፡ ተአምራቲሁ፡ ወመንክራቲሁ። <t:supplied reason="omitted">ለ</t:supplied>ዘከሠተ፡ ኅቡአቲሁ፡ በትንብልናሁ፡ ለሊቀ፡ መላእክት፡ ሩፋኤል፡ 
                        ወኮነ፡ ዓቢይ፡ ፍሥሓ፡ ወአዘዘ፡ ንጉሥ፡ ያጸርይዎ፡ ለውእቱ፡ ወርቅ፡ በእሳት፡ እስከ፡ ይትነጠፍ፡ እምርስሕቱ። ወበጊዜሃ፡ ገብሩ፡ ሥዕለ፡ ዓቢየ፡ ዘወርቅ። ንጡፍ፡ 
                        በዓምሳለ፡ ሊቀ፡ መላእክት፡ ሩፋኤል<t:supplied reason="omitted">፡</t:supplied>
                     </t:ab>
                  </t:div>
                  <t:div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:id="MiracleSeaMonster">
                     <t:label>Miracle of the keeper of a church, who was carried away by a sea monster</t:label>
                     <t:note>This miracle is different from <t:ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7164MRWhale">Dǝrsāna Rufāʾel element t:div with id LIT7164MRWhale</t:ref>, where a king is swallowed by a sea monster.
                        The following incipit is taken from <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/BAVet130">Vatican City, Biblioteca Apostolica Vaticana, Aeth. 130</t:ref> according to <t:bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/QZH8VYBF"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices"/><title level="m">Bybliothecae apostolicae Vaticanae codices manu scripti recensiti iussu Pii XI Pontificis maximi. Codices Aethiopici Vaticani et Borgiani, Barberinianus orientalis 2, Rossianus 865&lt;hi rend="italics"&gt;, I:&lt;/hi&gt; Enarratio codicum</title><author><t:forename>Sylvain</t:forename><t:surname>Grébaut</t:surname></author><author><t:forename>Eugène</t:forename><t:surname>Tisserant</t:surname></author><pubPlace>Città del Vaticano</pubPlace><publisher>In Bybliotheca Vaticana</publisher><date>1935</date><t:citedRange unit="page">522</t:citedRange></t:bibl>.
                     </t:note>
                     <t:ab>
                        <t:choice><t:sic>አጠይቀክሙ፡</t:sic><t:corr resp="PRS4805Grebaut PRS9530Tisseran">አጤይቀክሙ፡</t:corr></t:choice> ኦአኃውየ፡ ዕፁበ፡ ወመንክረ፡ 
                        ካልዓ፡ ዘገብረ፡ ተአምረ፡ ሊቀ፡ መላእክት፡ ጸሎቱ፡ <t:gap reason="ellipsis" resp="PRS4805Grebaut PRS9530Tisseran"/> ስምዑ፡ እንግርክሙ፡ ኦጉባኤ፡ ማኅበራ፡ ለቤተ፡ ክርስቲያን፡
                        ቅድስት፨ ሀሎ፡ ፩ዓቃቤ፡ ቤተ፡ ክርስቲያን፡ ወበአሐቲ፡ ዕለት፡ ቦአ፡ ከመ፡ ያብርህ፡ ማኅቶተ፡ ቅድመ፡ <t:sic>ሥዕል፡</t:sic> ክቡር፡ ሩፋኤል<t:supplied reason="omitted">፡</t:supplied>
                     </t:ab>
                  </t:div>
                  <t:div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:id="MiracleConstantine">
                     <t:label>On how Raphael appeared to emperor Constantine</t:label>
                     <t:note>
                        The following incipit is taken from <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/BAVet130">Vatican City, Biblioteca Apostolica Vaticana, Aeth. 130</t:ref> according to <t:bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/QZH8VYBF"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices"/><title level="m">Bybliothecae apostolicae Vaticanae codices manu scripti recensiti iussu Pii XI Pontificis maximi. Codices Aethiopici Vaticani et Borgiani, Barberinianus orientalis 2, Rossianus 865&lt;hi rend="italics"&gt;, I:&lt;/hi&gt; Enarratio codicum</title><author><t:forename>Sylvain</t:forename><t:surname>Grébaut</t:surname></author><author><t:forename>Eugène</t:forename><t:surname>Tisserant</t:surname></author><pubPlace>Città del Vaticano</pubPlace><publisher>In Bybliotheca Vaticana</publisher><date>1935</date><t:citedRange unit="page">523</t:citedRange></t:bibl>.
                     </t:note>
                     <t:ab>
                        ናሁ፡ ንጽሕፍ፡ ለክሙ፡ ኦአኃውየ፡ ፍቁራን፡ ኃይለ፡ ዘገብረ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ሊቀ፡ መላእክት፡ ሩፋኤል፡ አመ፡ ተፈነወ፡ ውስተ፡ ቤተ፡ ቈስጠንጢኖስ፡
                        ንጉሥ፡ ዘተመስሎ፡ ለአብርሃም፡ በሠዊዓ፡ ወልዱ፡ ወምንተ፡ ገብረ፡ ዝንቱ፡ መልአክ፡ ሩፋኤል፡ ወሶበ፡ ረከቦ፡ <t:supplied reason="omitted">ለ</t:supplied>ንዑሠ፡ 
                        መዋዕል፡ ወልዱ፡ ለቈስጠንጢኖስ፡
                     </t:ab>
                  </t:div>
                  <t:div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:id="MiracleTobias">
                     <t:label>Miracle of Tobias</t:label>
                     <t:note>
                        The following incipit is taken from <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/BAVet130">Vatican City, Biblioteca Apostolica Vaticana, Aeth. 130</t:ref> according to <t:bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/QZH8VYBF"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices"/><title level="m">Bybliothecae apostolicae Vaticanae codices manu scripti recensiti iussu Pii XI Pontificis maximi. Codices Aethiopici Vaticani et Borgiani, Barberinianus orientalis 2, Rossianus 865&lt;hi rend="italics"&gt;, I:&lt;/hi&gt; Enarratio codicum</title><author><t:forename>Sylvain</t:forename><t:surname>Grébaut</t:surname></author><author><t:forename>Eugène</t:forename><t:surname>Tisserant</t:surname></author><pubPlace>Città del Vaticano</pubPlace><publisher>In Bybliotheca Vaticana</publisher><date>1935</date><t:citedRange unit="page">523</t:citedRange></t:bibl>.
                     </t:note>
                     <t:ab>
                        ሣልስኒ፡ ተአምሪሁ፡ ለዝንቱ<t:supplied reason="omitted">፡</t:supplied> መልአክ፡ ነበረ፡ ፩ብእሲ፡ በዘመነ፡ አበዊነ፡ ቀደምት። 
                        <t:choice><t:sic>ዘልሙ</t:sic><t:corr resp="PRS4805Grebaut PRS9530Tisseran">ዘስሙ፡</t:corr></t:choice> ጦቢት፡ ወስመ፡ ወልዱ፡ ጦብያ። ወሠናይ፡ ውእቱ፡ 
                        ብእሲሁ፡ ወያፈቅሮ፡ ለእግዚአብሔር፨ <t:gap reason="ellipsis" resp="PRS4805Grebaut PRS9530Tisseran"/> ወበእንተ፡ ዝንቱ፡ ተጽሕፈ፡ ምስለ፡ ዜና፡ 
                        መልአክ፡ ሩፋኤል፡ መጽሐፈ፡ ነገሩ፡ ለጦቢት፡ ወልደ፡ ጦብያ፤ ወልደ፡ ገባል፡ ዘእምነ፡ አሳሔል፤ ዘእምነገደ፡ ንፍታሌም፤ 
                     </t:ab>
                  </t:div>
               </t:div>
               
